  "maxVersionNote": "1.0.6 20/10/2026: built from 1.0.5 (release-batch.mjs --overlay); every role variable the template paints is read with its own value as the fallback (role scan 0 unresolved), Vietnamese pages use Saira Extra Condensed; unworn the page is the release's own (VERIFICATION.json: 0 computed differences, same pixels). 1.0.5 16/10/2026 (#1375): re-cut of 1.0.4 with --move-only: a status colour set as text reads the slot's readable shade (--ds-c-<status>-text); nothing else moved, and unworn the page is the release's own (VERIFICATION.json).",
  "minVersionNote": "1.0.3 was released by another line (TCH #1175: its content contract, demo text) untokenized and with T3 dev mode on, after round 2 had built and measured its own 1.0.3; the tokenized build was redone from that released 1.0.3 and ships as 1.0.4 (RELEASE-DS-REBUILD.sh, TCH #1180)",
  "release": "quickstart/ja-restaurant/j6@1.0.4",
